            <h2 class="display">Three rules that don't bend.</h2>
            <p>They shape everything from how a beginner class is run to who gets picked for competition.</p>
 
            <div class="values-grid">
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-mark"></div>
                    <h4>Discipline first</h4>
                    <p>Show up on time, wrap your hands properly, listen before you swing. The habits matter
                        more than the punches.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-mark"></div>
                    <h4>Respect the floor</h4>
                    <p>Seniors spar with beginners. Coaches correct everyone the same way. Nobody outgrows the
                        fundamentals.</p>
                </div>
                <div class="value-card">
                    <div class="value-mark"></div>
                    <h4>Train for life, not just for fights</h4>
